node_modules/
docs/superpowers/
**/*.excalidraw.md
# Gitignored content dirs that remark would otherwise walk (it reads the
# filesystem, not git). Keep mirrored with .gitignore's markdown-bearing paths.
# The two worktree roots are the expensive ones — they hold whole sibling
# checkouts, so remark was re-validating another branch's docs on every run
# (~9s of a ~19s pass) and would have failed this branch's gate over a broken
# link in a doc that isn't on this branch.
.claude/research/
.stryker-tmp/
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
dist/
